BT /F1 10 Tf 28 666.6 Td (1. Which of the following is NOT one of the six core self-management skills?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 653.6 Td (Answer: Creativity \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 634.6 Td (2. What is the primary reason self-management matters in the workplace?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 621.6 Td (Answer: To maximize productivity and improve workplace performance \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 602.6 Td (3. According to the content, what should you do when developing organizational systems?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 589.6 Td (Answer: Use agenda books, apps, or filing systems to streamline activities \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 570.6 Td (4. What is the recommended approach instead of perfectionism?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 557.6 Td (Answer: Realize most decisions are reversible and adopt a scientist's mindset \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 538.6 Td (5. Which strategy helps you overcome the barrier of comparing yourself to others?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 525.6 Td (Answer: Recognize your unique path and compare yourself only to a previous version of you \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 506.6 Td (6. What is the key to overcoming 'Time Traps' according to the content?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 493.6 Td (Answer: Use your schedule consistently \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 474.6 Td (7. How should you handle vague goals?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 461.6 Td (Answer: Clarify goals in writing \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 442.6 Td (8. What does self-motivation ensure in the workplace?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 429.6 Td (Answer: Forward progress \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 410.6 Td (9. Which of the following is a recommended way to build self-management skills?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 44 397.6 Td (Answer: Assess your strengths and maximize those abilities \227 Correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 28 378.6 Td (10. What should you do instead of fearing failure?) Tj ET
